4) ✅ run-ematch-command.bat (para o Task Scheduler) COM QUEBRA DE LINHA

📌 Esse BAT é o que a task \eMatch Automation\RunEMatchDesktop deve executar (interactive).

Ele lê D:\Projects\eMatchStarters\run-context.properties
Ele roda o Katalon
Ele cria o marker ...\Reports\__jenkins_task_exitcode.txt com o exit code

Salve em D:\Projects\eMatchStarters\run-ematch-command.bat

@echo off
setlocal EnableExtensions EnableDelayedExpansion

set "CTX_FILE=D:\Projects\eMatchStarters\run-context.properties"

if not exist "%CTX_FILE%" (
  echo [ERROR] Context file not found: "%CTX_FILE%"
  exit /b 2
)

for /f "usebackq tokens=1,* delims==" %%A in ("%CTX_FILE%") do (
  set "K=%%A"
  set "V=%%B"
  if not "!K!"=="" set "!K!=!V!"
)

if "%WORKSPACE%"=="" (
  echo [ERROR] WORKSPACE is empty. Check run-context.properties
  exit /b 3
)

set "REPORTS_DIR=%WORKSPACE%\Reports"
if not exist "%REPORTS_DIR%" mkdir "%REPORTS_DIR%" >nul 2>&1

set "MARKER=%REPORTS_DIR%\__jenkins_task_exitcode.txt"
if exist "%MARKER%" del /f /q "%MARKER%" >nul 2>&1

set "PROJECT_PATH=%WORKSPACE%\%PROJECT_FILE%"

echo ------------------------------------------------------------ >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"
echo [INFO] WORKSPACE=%WORKSPACE% >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"
echo [INFO] PROJECT_PATH=%PROJECT_PATH% >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"
echo [INFO] KATALON_EXE=%KATALON_EXE% >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"
echo [INFO] COLLECTION_PATH=%COLLECTION_PATH% >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"
echo [INFO] BROWSER_TYPE=%BROWSER_TYPE% >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"
echo [INFO] RETRY=%RETRY% >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"
echo ------------------------------------------------------------ >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"

set "KATALON_CMD="%KATALON_EXE%" -noSplash -runMode=console -consoleLog -projectPath="%PROJECT_PATH%" -retry=%RETRY% -testSuiteCollectionPath="%COLLECTION_PATH%" -browserType="%BROWSER_TYPE%" -reportFolder="%REPORTS_DIR%""

echo [INFO] Starting Katalon... >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"
echo [INFO] %KATALON_CMD% >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"

cd /d "%WORKSPACE%"
%KATALON_CMD% 1>> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log" 2>&1

set "EC=%ERRORLEVEL%"
echo [INFO] ExitCode=%EC% >> "%REPORTS_DIR%\task.log"

> "%MARKER%" echo %EC%

exit /b %EC%

✅ Sobre “BAT veio sem pular linha”

Com os Groovy acima, o run-context.properties agora é escrito com \r\n
E o .bat acima já está com quebras reais
Se ainda abrir “tudo numa linha” no Notepad, é porque o arquivo foi salvo com LF em algum editor. Salve com Notepad do Windows mesmo.
